    "# 🛍️ SWID Practical 1: Market Day Quest\n",
    "\n",
    "Welcome, data lady! Today you shop at the market with Python. Along the way you will practise **variables, f strings, arithmetic and concatenation**.\n",
    "\n",
    "**How to play**\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Read the task in the text cell.\n",
    "2. Write your code in the code cell below it, under the comment line.\n",
    "3. Run your cell and match it with the expectd output\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ec24fa5f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Level 1: Meet Your Hero\n",
    "\n",
    "Every hero needs a name, an age and a home town. Let's build yours with variables."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c985cf11",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Task 1 \n",
    "\n",
    "Create these 5 variables, then print each one on its own line:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Variable | Value |\n",
    "| --- | --- |\n",
    "| `hero_name` | `'Chantal'` |\n",
    "| `hero_age` | `24` |\n",
    "| `hero_city` | `'Douala'` |\n",
    "| `hero_height` | `1.62` |\n",
    "| `is_coder` | `True` |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "6b1c3121",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Chantal\n",
      "24\n",
      "Douala\n",
      "1.62\n",
      "True\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Write your code below this line\n",
    "hero_name = 'Chantal'\n",
    "hero_age = 24\n",
    "hero_city = 'Douala'\n",
    "hero_height = 1.62\n",
    "is_coder = True\n",
    "\n",
    "print(hero_name)\n",
    "print(hero_age)\n",
    "print(hero_city)\n",
    "print(hero_height)\n",
    "print(is_coder)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# Expected output:\n",
    "# Chantal\n",
    "# 24\n",
    "# Douala\n",
    "# 1.62\n",
    "# True"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ff024e10",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
