   "source": [
    "### Task 20 · 8 points\n",
    "\n",
    "**Boss challenge.** Print this receipt. Use `'=' * 20` and `'-' * 20` for the lines, f strings for the item lines, and arithmetic for all the numbers. Use `.center(20)` for the title.\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "====================\n",
    "   MARKET RECEIPT   \n",
    "====================\n",
    "Shopper: Chantal\n",
    "Tomatoes: 6 x 350 = 2100 XAF\n",
    "Plantain: 2 x 1200 = 2400 XAF\n",
    "--------------------\n",
    "Subtotal: 4500 XAF\n",
    "Discount (10%): 450.0 XAF\n",
    "Total: 4050.0 XAF\n",
    "Paid: 5000 XAF\n",
    "Change: 950.0 XAF\n",
    "====================\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Hint:** Work out the numbers first (line totals, subtotal, discount, total, change). Then do the printing."
   ]
